TEXT -672 -176 Left 2 ;Only one channel of the AD4112 is modelled and other channels and related functions and pins are not modeled.The following parameters can be \ndefined by right-clicking on the AD4112 symbol. \n \nGAIN: Sets the gain of PGA.\ninputSEL: 0 for VIN1-VIN0 voltage input, 1 for VIN1 input, 2 for VIN0 input, 3 for IIN1 IIN0 input\nrefSEL: 0 for REFP-REFM, 1 for internal 2.5V reference, 2 for AVDD-AVSS\nclkSEL: 0 for internal 2 MHz clock, 1 for external clock, 2 for external oscillator with 16 MHz crystal\nFS_WORD: 1 to 31250
